      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "As your compliance officer, I recommend significantly strengthening the cautionary language dramatically. The current draft is far too promotional for a high-risk fund. I suggest rewriting the core message to clearly state that capital loss is a real possibility, which will naturally increase the weighted count in your risk analysis. For example, explicitly state that past performance is not indicative of future results, which provides a substantive disclosure and improves compliance visibility.",
